  "rules": [
    "Environment initialization must already be stable: reuse IopeEnvironment.plan with positive caller group metadata and refuse any changes.",
    "FirstCorridorLinkEnable must be true. Selected block is current corridor, first office or an enabled second office; group must already exist and not be 255. Role selectors and group editing are not performed.",
    "Environment wrapper never binds InputSource. Subclass SetBlock forces radio item1 before inherited initialization; inherited GetValues variant1 commits raw expiry and timer, skipping macro-group write because InputSource is nil.",
    "Corridor button passes true flag, office buttons false; subclass SetValue_ExpiryTime sets minimum00:01:00 only for corridor. Existing corridor duration below60 is refused because initial control normalization is not reproduced.",
    "Ordinary fresh block TimerMin attribute is initialized0; GetValues uses timer seconds encoded as uint16. TInputBlockB.HandleTimerMinAfterChange clamps only to that model minimum.",
    "PopulateExpiryFunctionsCombo admits function types0,9,11,12,13,15,16,22,23,24. This workflow admits types0,11,13,15 only.",
    "InitialiseKeyMicroFunctionFactory registers function type0/11/13/15 with new values0x00/0x4F/0x47/0x40. RegisterKeyMicroFunction stack arguments identify type and NewCBusValue.",
    "GetMicrofunctionCodeForRampRateAndRecallLevel case-table targets0xC8E915/0xC8ED47/0xC8ED53/0xC8ED6B return0x00/0x4F/0x47/0x40 independently of retained ramp and recall. cmbExpiryFunctionChange only invokes preset dialog for types6/12 and scene-index remap for22/23; neither path is admitted.",
    "Both retained and selected commands must be among the four simple full-byte commands; do not treat a classic nibble or unknown loaded command as a default.",
    "LoadInputBlocks retains raw byte at block+0xAC; SaveTimerExpiryCommand serializes exactly those8 bytes. TimerHigh/Low split uint16 seconds. Other block slots and all non-owned parameters are preserved.",
    "Apply recomputes the complete canonical plan, checks profile/native schema and all read dependencies, verifies staged readback and restores attempted fields on pre-save failure. This module never saves."
  ],
  "not_admitted": [
    "Timer variant switching or Pot1/Pot2 expiry editing",
    "Input macro functions and arbitrary input block timer entry",
    "Ramp, recall, scene and unknown retained commands",
    "Environment group selector edits, group creation or initialization rewrites",
    "Existing corridor duration below60",
    "Whole-dialog saves and original GUI lifecycle acceptance",
    "Physical timing, real-unit writes, power-cycle persistence"
  ],
